#. type: Title ===
#. mt: deepl
#: _versions/3.34/guides/maven-tooling.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "Remote repository access through authenticated HTTPS"
msgstr "Acesso remoto ao repositório por meio de HTTPS autenticado"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _versions/3.34/guides/maven-tooling.adoc
